WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.290 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:54.090 --> 01:57.090
Kaitou Jeanne, there's no escape now!

01:57.090 --> 01:59.890
Today will be the day I reveal your true identity.

02:00.180 --> 02:02.100
Don't move!

02:02.100 --> 02:03.850
I'll shoot if you move!

02:05.680 --> 02:10.400
- Hey, doesn't Kaitou Jeanne look like Kusakabe?

02:10.400 --> 02:13.400
- Yeah, she kinda does...

02:11.900 --> 02:13.400
- Exactly like Maron!

02:13.400 --> 02:17.700
No way! Maron can't possibly be Jeanne. It can't be!

02:17.700 --> 02:19.200
You sure?

02:19.200 --> 02:20.950
They look quite similar.

02:20.950 --> 02:22.490
Both are equally cute.

02:22.490 --> 02:24.240
Yeah, something about them is the same.

02:24.240 --> 02:26.120
Stop saying stupid things!

02:26.120 --> 02:31.710
Okay, then I'll reveal Jeanne's identity and prove Maron's innocence.

02:32.250 --> 02:33.170
Jeanne!

02:33.170 --> 02:36.460
Put your hands in the air and come closer!

02:40.760 --> 02:42.010
Maron!

02:47.520 --> 02:48.350
<i>Wait!</i>

02:49.730 --> 02:51.730
<i>You should go alone.</i>

02:54.610 --> 02:55.820
<i>All right.</i>

02:55.820 --> 02:58.570
<i>Miyako-chan, come over here!</i>

03:00.860 --> 03:02.450
<i>Please go find Maron.</i>

03:02.450 --> 03:04.830
<i>I understand. I promise I'll bring her back!</i>

03:11.790 --> 03:12.960
<i>I understand you...</i>

03:13.920 --> 03:16.710
<i>...because I'm always watching over you, Miyako.</i>

03:17.840 --> 03:23.470
<i>Chiaki is the first person Maron has talked to about her parents.</i>

03:24.300 --> 03:28.470
<i>That means Chiaki is the only person who can talk to her about it.</i>

03:29.730 --> 03:36.820
<i>Sympathetic words from someone she hasn't confided in...</i>

03:37.900 --> 03:39.820
<i>...won't persuade her to come home.</i>

03:44.740 --> 03:47.290
<i>Miyako is the daughter of a detective.</i>

03:47.290 --> 03:49.620
<i>She wouldn't do such a thing.</i>

03:53.750 --> 03:56.590
<i>Stupid Maron. I was so worried.</i>

04:01.130 --> 04:04.890
<i>Maron-chan!!! Wait!!!</i>

04:09.640 --> 04:10.930
<i>Chiaki!</i>

04:10.930 --> 04:12.730
<i>Put the gun down, Miyako!</i>

04:13.900 --> 04:16.650
Chiaki! Maron! Why?!

04:16.650 --> 04:19.940
Miyako, Maron is not Jeanne.

04:19.940 --> 04:21.610
Do you still want to shoot her?

04:25.030 --> 04:26.740
What is this?!

04:26.740 --> 04:28.330
What are you doing, Miyako?!

04:28.330 --> 04:31.290
I can't put it down. I can't put the gun down!

04:33.540 --> 04:35.000
Don't shoot!

04:36.330 --> 04:38.670
Run! Both of you, run!!

04:40.130 --> 04:41.510
Miyako...

04:44.880 --> 04:51.470
Miyako Shoots Love and Friendship!

04:52.680 --> 04:53.980
Maron!!!

04:59.980 --> 05:02.940
Why did I have to fall in love with Chiaki?!

05:16.580 --> 05:17.380
All right!

05:17.380 --> 05:19.460
What are you doing, Miyako?

05:19.460 --> 05:20.840
Chiaki!

05:21.380 --> 05:23.260
N-Nothing...

05:23.260 --> 05:24.920
Thanks for yesterday.

05:24.920 --> 05:27.800
It was because of you that I managed to bring Maron back.

05:28.390 --> 05:30.140
<i>Chiaki, you should go alone.</i>

05:30.680 --> 05:34.770
Of course! I know everything about Maron.

05:34.770 --> 05:36.980
Even when she's really sad, she's stubborn...

05:36.980 --> 05:39.860
...and will act tough even though she actually wants company.

05:39.860 --> 05:43.570
She's so clumsy. It's painful to watch.

05:43.570 --> 05:45.650
She's just like you, Miyako.

05:45.650 --> 05:49.490
Like me? Don't compare me with Maron...

05:49.490 --> 05:52.290
Oh no! I'll be late again because of her!

05:52.290 --> 05:54.330
I'm going ahead. See ya!

05:54.330 --> 05:55.330
Hey! Miyako!

06:02.500 --> 06:03.670
Chiaki!

06:03.670 --> 06:04.880
Good morning!

06:08.840 --> 06:10.970
Huh? Where's Miyako?

06:10.970 --> 06:13.390
She went on ahead, saying she'd be late.

06:13.390 --> 06:14.600
I see...

06:16.060 --> 06:19.560
Thanks for yesterday...

06:19.560 --> 06:23.570
It's okay. Well, we should get going.

06:23.570 --> 06:24.280
Yeah.

06:42.960 --> 06:45.630
Spike the ball quickly and be accurate!

06:56.350 --> 06:57.850
Miyako!

06:58.560 --> 06:59.770
Bring it on, Miyako!

06:59.770 --> 07:01.230
All right!

07:18.750 --> 07:21.250
Are you all right, Maron?

07:23.500 --> 07:26.880
You almost made it, Miyako.

07:30.130 --> 07:32.090
Someone take her to the nurse!

07:32.090 --> 07:33.800
- I'll go--

07:32.590 --> 07:33.800
- I'll take her!

07:35.100 --> 07:36.600
I'm okay!

07:36.600 --> 07:38.680
Yeah, you're pretty tough for a girl.

07:38.680 --> 07:40.270
That's mean!

07:55.910 --> 07:57.490
That hurt!

07:58.790 --> 08:01.250
Can't you do it more gently?

08:01.250 --> 08:03.540
I meant to be gentle.

08:04.380 --> 08:07.250
If you rub it that hard, the scratch will get worse.

08:07.250 --> 08:10.380
What are you gonna do if it scars?

08:10.380 --> 08:12.840
Then, I'll take care of you for the rest of my life!

08:12.840 --> 08:15.140
You're pathetic.

08:15.140 --> 08:18.850
I agree, it's not much of a proposal.

08:18.850 --> 08:20.560
- Stop joking!

08:19.390 --> 08:20.560
- Maron!

08:20.560 --> 08:21.770
Oh, Miyako!

08:21.770 --> 08:23.690
What's with that face?

08:24.600 --> 08:27.770
That's mean! You don't have to make fun about it!

08:27.770 --> 08:31.280
You seem all right. I didn't need to worry.

08:31.280 --> 08:33.490
I'll wait for you at the aerobics club.

08:36.450 --> 08:38.740
What am I doing...?

08:41.540 --> 08:45.250
<i>"A notice from Jeanne. Midnight, at the private art museum."</i>

08:45.710 --> 08:49.380
Jeanne, huh? What great timing!

08:49.380 --> 08:52.510
I'll put an end to her tonight!

09:07.270 --> 09:10.020
She's here. Are you all ready?

09:10.020 --> 09:11.110
Yes, ma'am.

09:22.540 --> 09:24.290
So this is the target.

09:25.370 --> 09:26.960
In the name of God...

09:27.630 --> 09:29.920
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

09:31.670 --> 09:33.260
I seal you here!

09:37.010 --> 09:40.100
Kaitou Jeanne! This is the end of you!

09:40.640 --> 09:43.350
I will reveal your identity!

09:45.810 --> 09:47.190
Don't move!

09:47.770 --> 09:49.770
I'll shoot if you move!

09:55.190 --> 09:57.400
Put your hands in the air and come closer.

09:57.400 --> 10:00.950
<i>- Hey, doesn't Kaitou Jeanne look like Kusakabe?</i>

10:04.790 --> 10:07.210
No! That's just a dream!

10:09.500 --> 10:10.540
I won't let you escape!

10:12.340 --> 10:15.010
Notice

10:12.340 --> 10:15.010
Don't go away!

10:12.340 --> 10:15.010
I'll return right after these messages!

10:12.340 --> 10:15.010
Kaitou Jeanne

10:15.880 --> 10:18.510
Notice

10:15.880 --> 10:18.510
I'm back to continue my adventures

10:15.880 --> 10:18.510
Kaitou Jeanne

10:18.930 --> 10:19.930
I won't let you escape!

10:23.390 --> 10:24.560
A water gun?!

10:29.770 --> 10:31.270
<i>Checkmate!</i>

10:33.900 --> 10:35.030
Now!

10:36.280 --> 10:39.570
Once again, I've taken a deceptive beauty tonight!

10:42.580 --> 10:44.240
She's stolen it again!

10:44.790 --> 10:50.040
<i>Something's odd. She didn't touch the picture directly, but it's still gone.</i>

10:50.040 --> 10:51.790
<i>What's up with this?!</i>

10:53.670 --> 10:55.630
The plan was successful.

10:55.630 --> 10:57.420
Way to go, Miyako-san!

10:57.760 --> 11:01.720
Extra, extra! What's going to happen to Jeanne?

11:01.720 --> 11:03.640
Buy the paper to find out!

11:08.930 --> 11:10.600
What am I gonna do...?

11:10.600 --> 11:15.610
It says that the ink won't come off for <i>at least</i> three days, no matter what!

11:15.980 --> 11:18.030
What should I do, Fin?!

11:19.570 --> 11:23.950
Maron! Maron, are you still sleeping? I'm going without you!

11:23.950 --> 11:25.660
What am I gonna do?

11:26.620 --> 11:28.120
Could you all line up?

11:28.120 --> 11:29.460
Overe here, please.

11:30.080 --> 11:32.290
Thank you very much for your cooperation.

11:32.290 --> 11:33.750
Next  person, come up please.

11:41.260 --> 11:43.390
We're sorry for the inconvenience.

11:43.390 --> 11:46.680
Will you take the bandage off, please?

11:46.680 --> 11:48.220
What?

11:48.220 --> 11:50.850
We are looking for Kaitou Jeanne.

11:50.850 --> 11:52.850
Are you saying that I am Kaitou Jeanne?

11:52.850 --> 11:56.650
That's what we're trying to find out! So please, take that bandage off!

11:59.650 --> 12:01.400
I...refuse...

12:01.400 --> 12:05.160
But it's our duty so we must check it out!

12:05.160 --> 12:06.450
I understand.

12:54.330 --> 12:56.330
Excuse us for taking your time!

12:59.920 --> 13:02.510
A red mark on Jeanne's right cheek...

13:02.510 --> 13:04.760
On Kusakabe's cheek...

13:05.590 --> 13:08.390
Doesn't Jeanne look like Maron?

13:08.390 --> 13:10.810
I've been thinking the same thing.

13:12.310 --> 13:15.060
It's the same place that Jeanne received the ink mark.

13:15.060 --> 13:17.190
I think Kusakabe really is Jeanne.

13:17.190 --> 13:19.020
Oh, really?

13:19.020 --> 13:21.360
But that bandage...

13:21.860 --> 13:25.820
Hey Miyako, aren't you concerned with Maron's bandage?

13:25.820 --> 13:27.240
Not at all.

13:27.910 --> 13:31.540
You guys are best friends. Are you covering for her?

13:31.540 --> 13:32.870
Nonsense.

13:32.870 --> 13:35.460
Thee is no way that Maron is Kaitou Jeanne.

13:35.460 --> 13:38.290
Toudaiji, aren't you going to be a detective?

13:38.290 --> 13:44.670
If there was any suspicion, a real detective would investigate it, no matter who it was.

13:44.670 --> 13:50.470
You always seeemed so desperate to catch Jeanne, or were you just doing it for fun?

13:51.220 --> 13:53.430
<i>For fun?</i>

13:56.310 --> 13:58.730
Let's get the class started.

13:58.730 --> 14:04.780
So keeping in mind the issues during the French Revolution...

14:04.780 --> 14:13.290
...the greatest issue of the Revolution came from...

14:13.290 --> 14:16.540
You always seeemed so desperate to catch Jeanne...

14:16.540 --> 14:19.250
<i>...or were you just doing it for fun?</i>

14:19.630 --> 14:24.760
<i>It's not for fun. The reason I'm chasing Jeanne...</i>

14:24.760 --> 14:28.130
The real reason I'm chasing Jeanne...

14:28.630 --> 14:34.010
<i>Anyone? Will anyone allow Miyako-chan into their group?</i>

14:38.940 --> 14:41.940
<i>Yeah! Right here!</i>

14:41.940 --> 14:44.980
<i>No! Not Miyako-chan!</i>

14:45.650 --> 14:46.940
<i>Why?</i>

14:46.940 --> 14:51.530
<i>Because Miyako-chan slapped my hand when I tried to get on the slide in the playground.</i>

14:51.530 --> 14:55.830
<i>She pulled Yumi-chan's skirt yesterday and she scares me!</i>

14:55.830 --> 14:59.040
<i>But... But I hit her hand because...</i>

14:59.040 --> 15:03.630
<i>But she hit your hand in order to warn you!</i>

15:05.130 --> 15:10.090
<i>The slide was still wet with paint. Didn't you notice, Ami-chan?</i>

15:10.090 --> 15:12.760
<i>What about when she pulled my skirt?</i>

15:12.760 --> 15:17.100
<i>Oh, that's because your skirt was tucked in your underwear.</i>

15:17.100 --> 15:18.810
<i>What?! Really?!</i>

15:18.810 --> 15:22.270
<i>I'm sorry, I was too embarrassed to tell you.</i>

15:22.270 --> 15:25.730
<i>It's okay. Miyako-chan, thank you!</i>

15:25.730 --> 15:29.070
<i>So that's why. I'm sorry, Miyako-chan.</i>

15:29.950 --> 15:31.740
<i>They finally understand me...</i>

15:31.740 --> 15:34.700
<i>Miyako-chan, come over here.</i>

15:41.460 --> 15:44.330
Okay!

15:45.130 --> 15:48.340
Hey, the class fees are gone!

15:48.340 --> 15:50.760
<i>What? Are you accusing me?</i>

15:50.760 --> 15:52.720
<i>But you're the one who collected them!</i>

15:52.720 --> 15:54.430
<i>Looks suspicious...</i>

15:54.430 --> 15:57.970
<i>I put it in the class box when I got here this morning!</i>

15:57.970 --> 16:00.890
<i>That's doubtful since you're so defensive about it.</i>

16:00.890 --> 16:01.850
<i>Yeah!</i>

16:04.520 --> 16:06.770
<i>You guys believe me, don't you?</i>

16:06.770 --> 16:07.900
<i>Of course.</i>

16:07.900 --> 16:10.490
<i>You're not the kind of girl who would do such a thing!</i>

16:10.490 --> 16:11.900
<i>So, can you just give it to us?</i>

16:18.990 --> 16:21.710
<i>Miyako is the daughter of a detective.</i>

16:21.710 --> 16:24.000
<i>She would never do such a thing.</i>

16:25.000 --> 16:26.130
<i>Well?</i>

16:26.130 --> 16:28.300
<i>Y-Yes...</i>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.050
<i>Maron...</i>

16:31.050 --> 16:35.260
<i>Oh, Toudaiji! I already got the class fees!</i>

16:35.260 --> 16:37.050
<i>Sensei!</i>

16:37.050 --> 16:38.560
<i>Oh...!</i>

16:38.560 --> 16:40.640
<i>Don't "Oh...!"</i>

16:40.640 --> 16:42.230
<i>It's okay, Maron.</i>

16:42.230 --> 16:43.440
<i>It's not!</i>

16:43.440 --> 16:47.020
<i>Do you know how it feels to be doubted?</i>

16:47.020 --> 16:48.690
<i>Apologize to Miyako!</i>

16:48.690 --> 16:51.030
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

16:51.030 --> 16:52.780
<i>Well done.</i>

16:53.110 --> 16:55.410
<i>It's okay, you guys.</i>

16:56.660 --> 17:02.250
<i>Maron was strong. She was always strong and happy.</i>

17:02.250 --> 17:06.000
<i>And she always helped and protected me.</i>

17:07.670 --> 17:11.630
<i>She was all alone then.</i>

17:11.630 --> 17:15.840
<i>There was nobody to protect her.</i>

17:15.840 --> 17:18.720
That's right!

17:19.850 --> 17:22.470
<i>So this time, I'll protect her.</i>

17:22.470 --> 17:25.560
<i>It's up to me to defend Maron's smile.</i>

17:25.560 --> 17:27.850
<i>I'll catch Kaitou Jeanne...</i>

17:27.850 --> 17:31.400
<i>...and prove that Maron is not Jeanne!</i>

17:31.400 --> 17:35.280
So this is why human rights laws were enacted.

17:35.280 --> 17:37.820
Toudaiji, what's wrong?

17:37.820 --> 17:40.330
I need to resolve a problem right now!

17:44.160 --> 17:46.710
I believe in Maron.

17:47.330 --> 17:50.710
Maron, take off that bandage.

17:50.710 --> 17:51.630
Huh?

17:52.130 --> 17:54.590
Prove your innocence to everyone!

18:12.940 --> 18:15.400
That hurt...

18:18.280 --> 18:21.410
Yesterday, after Miyako spiked the volleyball into my face,

18:21.410 --> 18:25.750
<i>someone</i> rubbed in disinfectant really hard, so...

18:27.960 --> 18:29.330
So that's what it was...

18:29.330 --> 18:32.340
- Oh...

18:30.460 --> 18:32.340
- Don't "Oh...!"

18:33.050 --> 18:35.050
Everyone! Apologize to Maron!

18:35.050 --> 18:36.260
It's okay, Miyako.

18:36.260 --> 18:38.930
It's not! Apologize!

18:38.930 --> 18:41.050
Sorry!

18:41.050 --> 18:42.180
Well done!

18:44.720 --> 18:47.180
Sorry, Maron....

18:48.350 --> 18:51.900
It's okay. Thank you, Miyako.

18:52.520 --> 18:54.190
Maron...

18:54.190 --> 18:58.780
Toudaiji, is the human rights issue resolved?

18:58.780 --> 19:00.450
Yes, Sensei!

19:00.450 --> 19:04.450
Then, I have to assign a penalty for your actions.

19:04.450 --> 19:06.950
Kusakabe, go re-apply your bandage.

19:06.950 --> 19:11.330
And Toudaiji, step out of the room for interrupting class!

19:11.330 --> 19:12.500
Yes, ma'am!

19:17.510 --> 19:20.090
That was close!

19:20.090 --> 19:21.800
Thank you, Fin.

19:22.840 --> 19:25.930
God, even though it was to help Jeanne...

19:25.930 --> 19:30.810
...please forgive me for using Your powers this way.

19:37.150 --> 19:38.740
Miyako?

19:44.160 --> 19:46.240
I'm late!

19:46.240 --> 19:47.700
What is it this time?

19:48.250 --> 19:51.670
<i>"A notice from Jeanne! 5:00 P.M., private library."</i>

19:51.670 --> 19:53.290
5:00?

19:54.130 --> 19:56.040
It's already 4:30!

20:02.430 --> 20:05.470
You called me up here and you're late...

20:06.930 --> 20:09.180
I-I'm sorry!

20:09.180 --> 20:12.230
You seem very intense today.

20:12.230 --> 20:14.940
What did you want to talk to me about?

20:16.940 --> 20:20.900
Listen carefully. I'll say this only once:

20:22.740 --> 20:23.860
All right.

20:25.320 --> 20:26.830
Thanks.

20:30.330 --> 20:36.080
I, Toudaiji Miyako, like you...Nagoya Chiaki.

20:36.080 --> 20:40.840
Will you, Nagoya Chiaki, accept Toudaiji Miyako's feelings?

20:43.430 --> 20:45.050
I'm sorry...

20:45.050 --> 20:46.550
Just as I thought...

20:46.550 --> 20:49.560
You don't need to apologize.

20:49.560 --> 20:51.350
But I'm happy, thanks to you.

20:51.350 --> 20:55.350
No, I'm grateful to you.

20:55.350 --> 20:59.650
No matter what your response was, I'm just happy you were honest.

20:59.650 --> 21:02.530
I'll leave Maron to you.

21:02.530 --> 21:07.070
She's even more stubborn than me and a klutz on top.

21:07.570 --> 21:09.950
Oh, I feel good!

21:09.950 --> 21:12.950
Now I can direct all my efforts towards catching Jeanne!

21:14.830 --> 21:16.330
See ya!

21:25.930 --> 21:27.640
It's Jeanne!

21:30.810 --> 21:32.720
She's escaping!

21:32.720 --> 21:34.140
That way!

21:37.150 --> 21:38.650
After her!

21:44.860 --> 21:46.860
I won't let you go today!

21:48.530 --> 21:51.030
I, Toudaiji Miyako...

21:52.450 --> 21:54.910
...will definitely catch you, Jeanne!

21:59.040 --> 22:01.750
Stop, Jeanne!

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.760 --> 23:36.310
Don't tell me...! Kaitou Jeanne has kidnapped someone?

23:36.310 --> 23:38.430
There has to be a mistake!

23:38.430 --> 23:42.100
I don't want to believe that the notice is from her.

23:42.100 --> 23:48.030
If she did kidnap Chiaki's father, she won't be forgiven!

23:48.030 --> 23:52.110
If Jeanne isn't the culprit, then who is?!

23:52.110 --> 23:56.370
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Dive! The Death of the Double Kaitou

23:57.290 --> 23:59.330
Chiaki, watch ouuuuut!!!
